    79	## 2. Multi-clause heads
    80	
    81	The one structural move the language rests on: C#'s pattern grammar moves out of `switch` arms and
    82	into the **parameter position**, and N declarations are allowed where C# allows one.
    83	
    84	<!-- check:
    85	type Verdict = :positive | :zero | :negative | :unknown
