name: org-brain
description: Search and apply org-wide architectural decisions and heuristics via the org-brain MCP server before ANY non-trivial implementation work — not only dependency, infra, or deploy forks but also building a feature or MCP tool/endpoint, writing or designing tests, and choosing how to structure, test, or query code. Use when adding dependencies, changing deploy/CI shape, introducing infrastructure, implementing a feature, writing tests (what level, against what), picking a data-access/query or testing approach, or facing any fork where the team may already have a convention. Also use when the user mentions team knowledge, org-brain, decision cards, or heuristic cards.
